ProjectALife = ProjectALife or {}
ProjectALife.DialogueShards = ProjectALife.DialogueShards or {}
ProjectALife.DialogueShards["barks_enc_1"] = {
{"ENC_AGAIN","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"I remember you. Keep on going, all right?","Same as before, then. Nobody bothers anybody","Still alive, huh? Good. Just keep a little room","Back around again? Don't give us a reason","Oh, it's you again - go on, we don't want trouble"}},
{"ENC_AGAIN","reg=law",{"Oh, it's you. Go on through, same as before","Saw you once already. I remember, so mind yourself","Thought that was you. Stay easy and we'll stay easy","We've crossed paths. Don't make me regret that","You again - keep moving and we're fine"}},
{"ENC_AGAIN","reg=swat,military,elite",{"You again. Keep walking, same as before","Same face as last time. Don't make me regret it","Easy, we've done this once already. You pass, we pass","Thought you'd be dead by now. Keep your distance","We've met - keep your distance and carry on"}},
{"ENC_AGAIN","reg=outlaw,club,crime",{"Twice now you've walked away from us. Don't push for three","Back so soon? Go on through, we're feeling generous","I remember you. Let's both be glad about it","Ha, there's my lucky pal. Keep walking before somebody gets greedy","Well, look who it is - keep walking, friend"}},
{"ENC_AGAIN","reg=raider,gang,prison",{"Look who still ain't dead","Still breathing? Lucky ass","Back for seconds? Last time I was feeling generous","Thought you'd have run clean out of the county by now","You again? Walk on before I change my mind"}},
{"ENC_ASK_CARRY","reg=outlaw,club,crime",{"Let's see what you dragged in. What are you hauling?","You look loaded down. Tell me what's in it, I'm nosy","Got anything worth looking at? I'm easy to impress","Let me have a peek. A peek never hurt nobody","What's in the pockets? Don't hold out on me, I always find out","Tell me what you're toting. Lie and I'll know it","What're you carrying, friend? Be honest now"}},
{"ENC_ASK_CARRY","reg=raider,gang,prison",{"Let's see the pack. Dump it, all of it","Whatcha hauling? Food? Shells? Don't hold out on me","Anything worth taking on you, or are you as broke as you look?","Open that bag slow. If I like what's in it, you live longer","Hands off the bag. What's in it?","Pockets out. All of 'em, I'll know if you skip one","What you got on you? Empty them pockets"}},
{"ENC_ASK_CARRY","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"What have you got in that bag?"}},
{"ENC_ASK_CARRY","reg=law",{"What are you carrying? Any weapons on you?"}},
{"ENC_ASK_CARRY","reg=swat,military,elite",{"What are you carrying? Weapons, ammunition?"}},
{"ENC_ASK_HOWMANY","reg=law",{"Anybody with you? Be straight with me","Just you, or is there more of you somewhere close?","Count them off for me. How many are with you?","You traveling alone? Not many manage that now","If I go looking, am I going to find more of you?","Who else is with you? I'd rather hear it from you than find it out","How many of you are out here? Don't lie to me"}},
{"ENC_ASK_HOWMANY","reg=swat,military,elite",{"You alone out here? Don't lie, I'll know","Anybody else with you? Count them for me","How many? A number, that's all I need","One of you, or a dozen? Tell me before I find out","Is it only you, or are there more waiting somewhere?","Give me a head count. Who's out there with you?","How many in your group? Where are they?"}},
{"ENC_ASK_HOWMANY","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"Are there more of you out there?"}},
{"ENC_ASK_HOWMANY","reg=outlaw,club,crime",{"How many friends you got nearby?"}},
{"ENC_ASK_HOWMANY","reg=raider,gang,prison",{"How many of you are there?"}},
{"ENC_ASK_INTENT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"What are you after out here? Just tell me straight","Where you headed? Not here, I hope","You passing through, or are you staying?","What brings you this way? Nobody comes this way anymore","Looking for somebody? Looking for something? I'd rather know","Are you lost, or do you know where you're going?","Are you looking for trouble? Because we don't want any"}},
{"ENC_ASK_INTENT","reg=law",{"You looking for trouble out here?"}},
{"ENC_ASK_INTENT","reg=swat,military,elite",{"State your intentions"}},
{"ENC_ASK_INTENT","reg=outlaw,club,crime",{"You here to cause trouble?"}},
{"ENC_ASK_INTENT","reg=raider,gang,prison",{"You looking for a fight?"}},
{"ENC_ASK_WHO","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"Do I know you? I don't think I know you","What do they call you? Go on, tell me","You from around here? I don't recognize you","Who're you? Did somebody send you?","Say your name. Go on. I'd like to know who I'm looking at","Hold on, I think I... no. Who are you?","Who are you? What are you doing here?"}},
{"ENC_ASK_WHO","reg=law",{"Name first. Then we'll talk about the rest","You from around here, or just passing through? Give me a name","I don't recognize you. Who are you?","Where you from, and what do they call you?","Before we go any further, I need to know who I'm talking to","Somebody's probably looking for you. Who are you?","Who are you, and what's your business here?","Let's start with a name - who are you?"}},
{"ENC_ASK_WHO","reg=swat,military,elite",{"Name. And what are you doing out here?","Who are you? Short answer, I'm not in the mood","You military? Police? Or just somebody walking around?","Where are you from, and what do they call you?","Nobody told me to expect you. Who are you?","Say your name, loud enough that I hear it","Identify yourself - who are you with?"}},
{"ENC_ASK_WHO","reg=outlaw,club,crime",{"What do they call you? Everybody's called something","Say your name nice and clear. I like knowing who I'm talking to","Where'd you crawl out of, and who's your people?","I know the look but not the name. Let's fix that","Go on, introduce yourself - manners are free","Who might you be? You ain't from around here, or I'd know the face","So who are you, and who sent you?","You got a name, or do I pick one for you?"}},
{"ENC_ASK_WHO","reg=raider,gang,prison",{"Name. And it better not be a lie","Who sent you sniffing around out here?","Where you from? Louisville? Radcliff? Spit it out","I don't know your face, and I don't like that. Who are you?","Talk. Who you running with?","Another stray, huh? Who do you belong to?","Who the hell are you?"}},
{"ENC_BASE_CALLOUT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"Hello the place!! We see the fence, we're not looking for trouble, can we talk?","Hey!! Hey, in there, we're just folks, we're hungry and tired, anybody home?","Hello? We saw someone moving in there, you're still alive, can we come closer?","Please don't shoot, we're not armed, we just want to talk, please, please!","Anybody there? We've got a little girl with us, she's sick, please, can we talk?","Hey, neighbors!! We're friendly, honest, we saw the fence, you did a good job","Hello the house! We see your fence, we're not here to rob you - come out and talk!"}},
{"ENC_BASE_CALLOUT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh",{"H-hello?? Hello?? Please, please don't shoot, we're coming slowly!","Is anybody in there? We're so tired, we've been walking since yesterday!"}},
{"ENC_BASE_CALLOUT","reg=family",{"Hello, friends!! We're a family, nine of us, we'd like to talk, if you'll have us","Hello the house!! We're just folks, we ain't looking for a fight!"}},
{"ENC_BASE_CALLOUT","reg=law,swat",{"Sheriff's office!! We're not here to hurt anyone, come to the fence and talk!","Deputies out here, you've got a nice setup, come say hello!","Police, folks!! We need to confirm who lives here, come forward, slowly!"}},
{"ENC_BASE_CALLOUT","reg=military,elite",{"Soldiers out here!! Identify yourselves, come to the fence!","Patrol outside the compound, state your business, hands visible!","Attention, residents, we're here to check on you, approach the fence!"}},
{"ENC_BASE_CALLOUT","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison",{"Hey!! Nice little fort you got there, mind if we come in?","Hello in there!! Open up, we want to talk, nice and friendly!","You've got a lot of nice stuff in there, I bet, how about sharing?","Knock knock, motherfuckers!! Come out and play!","Come on out, we won't bite, much, ha ha!","Fence boy, we know you're in there, don't make us climb!"}},
{"ENC_BASE_CALLOUT","reg=raider,prison",{"Open up!! Open up or we'll burn it down!","You've got one minute, one MINUTE, then we come in!"}},
{"ENC_BASE_CALLOUT","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|tmp=predator",{"Hey!! Rabbits!! Come out, the wolves are hungry!"}},
{"ENC_BASE_CALLOUT","reg=law",{"Sheriff's department! You've got the place fixed up real good - come out where we can see you!"}},
{"ENC_BASE_CALLOUT","reg=swat,military,elite",{"Attention, the compound! Come out to the fence with your hands visible!"}},
{"ENC_BASE_CALLOUT","reg=outlaw,club,crime",{"Nice place you got - come out to the fence and we'll talk about it"}},
{"ENC_BASE_CALLOUT","reg=raider,gang,prison",{"Hey! Nice little fort! Come out here before we come in!"}},
{"ENC_BETRAY","reg=outlaw,club,crime",{"Close it up, now!","Go on and say hello from behind!","Quick, while this one's still looking at me!","Now's the time - grab this one!","Now!","Take {him}!"}},
{"ENC_BETRAY","reg=raider,gang,prison",{"Down {him} - go, go, go!","Behind {him}! Hit {him} now!","Lay {him} out, quick!","Done talking. Take {him} from behind!","Now! Get {him}!","Do it!"}},
{"ENC_CALLOUT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"Anybody in there? We saw something move. We're not going to hurt you","Hey, whoever's inside - we're just ordinary people, we only want to talk","I know you can hear me. Come on out, nobody's mad at you","If somebody's in there, just say something. Anything","Hello in there? We know somebody's inside - come on out, we just want to talk","Whoever's in the house, please come out slow, nobody has to get hurt"}},
{"ENC_CALLOUT","reg=law",{"Somebody's in there and we both know it. Come on out and talk","County law out here! Come on out before somebody gets stupid","I know you can hear me. Step on out with empty hands","Anybody in there? Nobody's in trouble yet, so come on out","Sheriff's department! Whoever's in there, come out with your hands up!","We know you're inside - walk out slow and nobody gets hurt"}},
{"ENC_CALLOUT","reg=swat,military,elite",{"We know somebody's in there. Come out slow, hands empty","Whoever's in the building - step out and talk. Nobody has to fire","You in there! Come out and tell us who you are","You can't sit in there forever. Come on out, we'll talk","Attention, the building! Come out with your hands visible! You will not be harmed!","Occupant of the house! Exit the building now, hands first!"}},
{"ENC_CALLOUT","reg=outlaw,club,crime",{"Somebody's in there, I can feel it. Come say hello - we don't bite hard","Anybody home? We saw you looking. Show your face and everybody relaxes","Hey, in there! Come meet the neighbors - we brought questions","Step on out, partner. We'd rather talk than break something","Hey, in the house! We know you're in there - come on out and let's talk like people","Come on out, friend, don't make us come in after you"}},
{"ENC_CALLOUT","reg=raider,gang,prison",{"Hey! Yeah, you! We saw you move, so quit hiding","Your pick, friend. Walk out now or get dragged out later","Standing out here is making me mean. Get on out here","Don't make me guess who's in there. I'm a loud guesser","We know you're in there! Get out here, now!","Come on out! We ain't got all day!"}},
{"ENC_CALLOUT_REPEAT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"We can hear you moving around in there. Come on out","It's been a good while now. Say something, at least","I'm asking nicer than I feel. Come on out","Hello? Are you hurt? Is that why you're not answering?","Please, we're not looking for a fight, just come out and talk to us"}},
{"ENC_CALLOUT_REPEAT","reg=law",{"Last time I ask nice. Come on out of there","You've had your minute. Get out here, now!","I can hear you moving around in there. Quit stalling!","Patience is gone. Out here, or we come and get you","I'm not gonna say it again - come out of the house"}},
{"ENC_CALLOUT_REPEAT","reg=swat,military,elite",{"I said out! Hands empty, and don't make me come get you","We can hear you moving in there. Quit stalling","Nobody's got time for this. Out, now","Come on... come on out. We're tired and you're not helping","Second call, exit the building now"}},
{"ENC_CALLOUT_REPEAT","reg=outlaw,club,crime",{"Still waiting on you. My patience has a bottom, and I can see it from here","I asked nice once. I'm a bad hand at asking nice twice","Hey! You've had your minute and then some. Out, now","Last of the nice, friend. Come out or we come get you","Clock's running, friend - come on out"}},
{"ENC_CALLOUT_REPEAT","reg=raider,gang,prison",{"I know you heard me. I ain't asking a third time","That's twice I asked nice. Next time I ask with a match","Hiding ain't fixing nothing, you hear me? Out, now!","My friend here is itching to kick something in. Don't tempt him","You deaf in there? Get out here!"}},
{"ENC_CAME_OUT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"Okay, there you are. Let me see your hands","I know that took nerve. Stay there a second","Just a person, after all. Thank God","Good, that's better. Now we can talk","Nice and easy now"}},
{"ENC_CAME_OUT","reg=law",{"There you are. Now stay put","Good. Took some nerve. Let me look at you","Alright, you're out. Keep your hands loose and talk to me","Okay. Don't make me sorry I asked","Slow, that's it, now stop right there"}},
{"ENC_CAME_OUT","reg=swat,military,elite",{"There you are. Keep your hands open and empty","Good. That wasn't so hard. Stay right there","Alright, you're out. Stand still and let me look at you","Slow... slow. We'll do the talking from here","Halt there, that's close enough"}},
{"ENC_CAME_OUT","reg=outlaw,club,crime",{"Well, look at you, all in one piece. Come a little closer","There's the guest of honor! Don't mind us, we're harmless","Glad you could join us. Hands easy, that's all I ask","Still breathing? Good start. Come on over here","There we go - wasn't so hard, was it?"}},
{"ENC_CAME_OUT","reg=raider,gang,prison",{"Finally! Thought you'd died in there","Took you long enough. Come here, slow, hands out","Look who's brave. Hands out front, buddy","Well, there's the hermit. Say hi to everybody","There {he} is - stand right there"}},
{"ENC_CAUGHT","reg=outlaw,club,crime",{"Huh. You see things. Alright, we're done here","Ha! Caught us. No hard feelings, we'll be going","Sharp. Forget what you saw and we'll call it even","Easy, easy. Lower that, we're leaving","Alright, you're sharper than you look - we're going"}},
{"ENC_CAUGHT","reg=raider,gang,prison",{"Hell, you've got eyes. Back off, boys","Shit, {he} saw you. Forget it","Okay, okay, no harm done. Easy... we're going","Sharp. Real sharp. Go on, we were only joking","Fine, you caught it - we're leaving"}},
{"ENC_COME_OUT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"I can hear you fine. I'd just feel better looking at you","Okay, so you're alive. Come on out, slowly","Thank God somebody's answering. Come on out, please","Step outside, would you? I can't tell a thing from out here","We hear you - come out where we can see you, please"}},
{"ENC_COME_OUT","reg=law",{"So you can talk. Come out and do it to my face","A voice isn't enough for me. Step on out","I hear you. Now let me see you. Come on","Walking out won't get you shot. Come on","Come on out of there, slow, where I can see you"}},
{"ENC_COME_OUT","reg=swat,military,elite",{"Good, you can hear us. Now step out","Talking from in there doesn't help. Come out","Better. Now show yourself, slow","I'd rather see who I'm talking to. Step out","Copy, now come out - hands first"}},
{"ENC_COME_OUT","reg=outlaw,club,crime",{"Hearing you is nice. Seeing you is better. Step out","A voice is a start. Now bring the rest of you out here","Don't make me holler all day. Come out and talk face to face","I can't shake a voice's hand. Come on out"}},
{"ENC_COME_OUT","reg=raider,gang,prison",{"Talking's easy from in there. Come say it to my face","I can hear you fine. Now let me see you","Out. Hands first, and nothing sharp in them","Nice speech. Now step out and finish it","Yeah? Then get out here and say it!"}},
{"ENC_COME_OUT","reg=outlaw,club,crime|world=building",{"Talking through a wall don't count - come on out"}},
{"ENC_DEMAND_DROP","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"Point that at the ground, would you? Please","Set it down. Slow. Then take a step back from it","I can't think straight with that in your hand. Put it down","Drop it, please - I'm begging you, just drop it","You don't need that to talk to us. Lay it down","That thing makes everybody nervous. Set it down, we'll talk","Put that down! Please, just put it down!"}},
{"ENC_DEMAND_DROP","reg=law",{"Lower that, and set it down slow","Easy with that thing. Put it down before somebody gets hurt","Let go of it. Open your hand and let it fall","You don't need that right now. Set it on the ground","I'd rather not shoot anybody today. Put it down","Toss it aside, then step back from it","Drop the weapon! Drop it now!","Put it on the ground! Do it!"}},
{"ENC_DEMAND_DROP","reg=swat,military,elite",{"Lower it. Nice and slow","Drop it! Come on, drop it, don't make me do this","Whatever's in your hand, it goes on the ground. Now","Easy with that... set it down. Slow, no sudden moves","Put it down and step back from it","Down with it, or I put you down. Your call","Weapon down! Now!"}},
{"ENC_DEMAND_DROP","reg=outlaw,club,crime",{"Set it down gentle. I've got jumpy people here and I can't vouch for them","Ease that down in the dirt. Nobody has to get famous today","You hold that like you mean it. Don't. Put it on the ground","Drop it and take two steps back, and we all keep breathing","Saw it the second you walked up. Lay it down and we'll talk like grown folks","That makes my people itchy. Put it down before somebody scratches","Put that iron down, real slow","Lower it, you don't want to do this"}},
{"ENC_DEMAND_DROP","reg=raider,gang,prison",{"Lose the hardware, buddy. Slow, on the dirt","Put that down or I put you down. Your call","That thing's making me nervous. Set it down, nice and easy","You gonna wave that at me? Drop it, genius","Toss it over here. Handle first, if you like breathing","I'm counting to three and I can't count past two. Drop it","Drop it! Drop it or you're dead!"}},
{"ENC_DEMAND_LEAVE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"Turn around and go back the way you came","There's nothing here for you. Go on, now","We've got nothing to give you. Keep walking, please","I need you gone. Not tomorrow, now","Find somewhere else. Anywhere else, just not near us","Back off now, and we'll forget we ever saw you","This is our place - please, just go"}},
{"ENC_DEMAND_LEAVE","reg=law",{"Turn around and go back the way you came","Nothing for you here. Find another way around","This stretch is ours to watch. Go around","Go on, git. I'd hate to put anybody in cuffs over this","Don't be here when I look again","You can't stay, and you can't come through. Turn back","I want you out of this area - today"}},
{"ENC_DEMAND_LEAVE","reg=swat,military,elite",{"Turn around and go back the way you came","You're not coming through here. Find another way round","Not here. Go find somewhere else to be","No further. Walk away, and don't circle back on us","You don't want what's past us. Go back","That's as far as you go. Get moving, other direction","This area is restricted - leave now"}},
{"ENC_DEMAND_LEAVE","reg=outlaw,club,crime",{"Nothing on you worth the bother. Turn around and keep walking","We got no use for you. Go back the way you came, and do it smiling","This stretch is spoken for. Find yourself another way around","You're in the wrong place, friend. Turn around while it's still your idea","Go on, git. Kindness is wearing thin","Not your day to pass through here. Back you go, and don't look sore about it"}},
{"ENC_DEMAND_LEAVE","reg=raider,gang,prison",{"Nothing here for you. Turn around and keep walking","Beat it. Go on, before I get interested in you","This ain't your corner. Take your sorry ass elsewhere","We don't want you around. Go find another hole","Back the way you came, buddy, and don't look back at us","You're in our way. Shove off while you still can","Get lost, and don't come back"}},
{"ENC_DEMAND_LEAVE","reg=outlaw,club,crime|world=road",{"Then you best be moving on, this ain't your road"}},
{"ENC_DEMAND_TOLL","reg=outlaw,club,crime",{"Everybody pays to pass. Food, bullets, a shiny thing - I ain't picky","Walking costs extra these days. Leave something on the ground and keep your legs","Simple math: you hand over something useful, you keep your teeth","Passing costs. Cans, shells, medicine, I'll look at anything","I'm a reasonable soul. Ante up something worth my time and you walk free","Put a little something in the hat and you're on your merry way","Toll's due, friend, something to eat, something to shoot - your choice"}},
{"ENC_DEMAND_TOLL","reg=raider,gang,prison",{"Cost you to stand here. Food, shells, whatever's shiny","Leave something behind and you keep your teeth","Pay up. Cans, bullets, a watch, I ain't picky","Walking through our turf ain't free, pal. What've you got?","Think of it as rent. Hand over something worth having","Empty your hands of the good stuff and we're square","You want to walk out of here, you pay - now","Nobody passes free, hand it over"}},
{"ENC_DEMAND_TOLL","reg=outlaw,club,crime|world=road",{"This road's ours, passing costs something - what've you got?"}},
{"ENC_GIVE_UP","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"We lost them, let's go home"}},
{"ENC_GIVE_UP","reg=law",{"We lost {him}, let's head back"}},
{"ENC_GIVE_UP","reg=swat,military,elite",{"Lost contact - breaking off"}},
{"ENC_GIVE_UP","reg=outlaw,club,crime",{"Trail's cold, let's move on"}},
{"ENC_GIVE_UP","reg=raider,gang,prison",{"Forget it, {he}'s long gone"}},
{"ENC_JOIN_NO","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"No. I'm sorry, but no. There's not enough to go around","We can't take a chance on somebody we don't know. Not now","It's not about you, honest. We just can't stretch any further","I hope you find your own people. We can't be them","I'm sorry, we can't trust anybody right now"}},
{"ENC_JOIN_NO","reg=law",{"No. I don't know you well enough to turn my back","I'd like to say yes. Can't, though, not with strangers","We're not taking anybody on. Go find your own people","Rules say no, and the rules are about all I've got left","Not today - move along"}},
{"ENC_JOIN_NO","reg=swat,military,elite",{"No. We don't take on strangers, so don't ask twice","Not a chance. I don't know you from anybody","Can't do it. I'm not putting my people at risk for a stranger","There's no room and no orders for it. Find somebody else","Negative - keep moving"}},
{"ENC_JOIN_NO","reg=outlaw,club,crime",{"Ride with us? We barely put up with each other as it is","Nope. Strangers get folks killed, and I like my folks","Join us? You'd last a day, and I'd end up burying you","The answer's no, but I admire the nerve","We got enough mouths - move on"}},
{"ENC_JOIN_NO","reg=raider,gang,prison",{"Run with us? Hell no. We barely trust each other","Go find your own pack, stray","We ain't taking strays. Keep walking","Ha! You? I'd sooner share a cell with a rattlesnake","No chance"}},
{"ENC_JOIN_YES","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"Well... all right. Walk with us, but go easy","Okay. Okay, come on. I'd rather have one more than one less","Another pair of eyes wouldn't hurt. Come on, then","My gut says no, but my gut's been wrong. Come on","Really? Yeah, we could use the help, come on"}},
{"ENC_JOIN_YES","reg=law",{"Alright, you can tag along. Don't give me a reason to regret it","Fall in behind us, and we'll see how you do","Lord knows we could use the company. Keep up, now","Somebody has to start trusting somebody. Come on","We could use another hand - stay in front of me for now"}},
{"ENC_JOIN_YES","reg=swat,military,elite",{"Alright. Stay close, stay quiet. Do as you're told","Fine. One mistake and you're on your own","We could use another pair of eyes. Don't make me regret it","You walk behind me. Anything looks wrong, you drop flat. Clear?","Fine, you follow my lead, understood?"}},
{"ENC_JOIN_YES","reg=outlaw,club,crime",{"You've got nerve, and I like nerve. Keep up and stay in front","Alright, tag along. First one to bring trouble walks home alone","Ah, why not. Another pair of hands never hurt a crew","Fine. Walk with us. Try to be less annoying than you look","Maybe - walk with us a while and we'll see"}},
{"ENC_JOIN_YES","reg=raider,gang,prison",{"Ah, hell. Get in line, and stay where I can see you","You can carry the heavy stuff. Prove yourself first","Fine, tag along. Steal from us and we'll bury you","Damn, alright. Keep up, keep quiet, don't touch my stuff","Huh - alright, one wrong move, though"}},
{"ENC_LEAVE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"Leave {him} be. Come on, quiet now","Nobody turn around. Just walk","I've had enough of this. We're going","Back up, all of you. Slow. Then we go","Gather up. We're leaving, right now","Let's get out of here before somebody does something stupid","Come on, let's go, let's just go"}},
{"ENC_LEAVE","reg=law",{"Leave it. We've got somewhere to be","Come on, we ain't got time for this. Move","Fall in, everybody. Let's put some distance between us","That's enough of that. Back the way we came, quiet","Pull back easy, and watch behind us","We'll leave it there. Everybody with me","We're done here, let's move out"}},
{"ENC_LEAVE","reg=swat,military,elite",{"Pack it up. We're leaving this one be","Not worth the ammunition. Let's go","Eyes behind us for the first hundred yards. Go","Enough. Time's wasting, form up","Leave it. We've got somewhere to be","Lower your weapons, stay loose. We walk away, slow","Fall back - move out"}},
{"ENC_LEAVE","reg=outlaw,club,crime",{"Pack it in, y'all. This one's not worth a bullet","Come on, we've wasted enough breath here. Move out","Show's over. Let's find somebody with more to give","We're done, we're done. Move it, before I have second thoughts","Leave it. There's better pickings up ahead","Let's roll. Nothing here worth the walk","Not worth it, let's go, boys"}},
{"ENC_LEAVE","reg=raider,gang,prison",{"Leave {him}. {He} ain't worth the shells","Let's roll, boys. Nothing here but wasted time","Eh, this is boring. Move out","Enough. Let's find somebody with something worth taking","Come on, we're wasting time out here","Whatever, let's go","Forget it, come on, we're leaving"}},
{"ENC_NO_FLANKER","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"What? There's nobody back there, look for yourself","We're all standing right here. Who would be behind you?","Sneaking? Who's sneaking? We're scared, not crazy","Behind you? There's no one there. Are you seeing things?","Nobody's sneaking anywhere - calm down"}},
{"ENC_NO_FLANKER","reg=law",{"Behind you? Everybody I've got is right here in front of you","Sneaking up? We've been standing here the whole time","I don't see a soul behind you. Take a breath","Not one of ours back there. Whatever you heard, it's not us","Nobody's moving on you - relax"}},
{"ENC_NO_FLANKER","reg=swat,military,elite",{"Nobody's behind you. Turn and look, if it helps","We're all in front of you. Count us","Easy. There's nobody back there. Quit jumping at shadows","Your nerves are talking. Nothing back there","No one is flanking you - stay calm"}},
{"ENC_NO_FLANKER","reg=outlaw,club,crime",{"Sneaking? Look behind you all you want. There's just your nerves back there","You've been watching too many Westerns. Nobody's behind you","Ha! Jumpy, ain't you? Go on and turn around, see who's there","If I wanted you from behind I'd have started there. Relax","Nobody's going anywhere - breathe"}},
{"ENC_NO_FLANKER","reg=raider,gang,prison",{"Ha! Jumpy, ain't you? Nobody's back there","Behind you? Nobody's there but your own nerves","Look at you, seeing ghosts. Ain't nobody sneaking nowhere","You calling us sneaky? Hell, we'd rather do it to your face","Nobody's behind you - relax"}},
{"ENC_PAID","reg=outlaw,club,crime",{"Good as gold. Go on through and watch your step","Mm, that'll keep us fed a spell. Move along","Obliged. Spread the word that we're fair","Not much, but I'm a forgiving sort. Go on","Ha! A gift! Keep walking before I get greedy","Paid and polite. Rare combination. Go on","Pleasure doing business"}},
{"ENC_PAID","reg=raider,gang,prison",{"Now was that so hard?","Hell yeah, now we're talking","That'll do, for today","Look at that, a sensible one","Is that all? Pathetic... fine, get out of here","Nobody bleeds today. Thank you for that","Smart - real smart"}},
{"ENC_PART","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"All right. You go your way and we'll go ours","You be careful now. Go on","Safe travels... if there's such a thing anymore","Well, thanks for being reasonable","I hope you find whatever it is you're looking for","Lord keep you, whoever you are","Go on, then, good luck"}},
{"ENC_PART","reg=law",{"That's all I needed. Go on, and watch yourself out there","Be careful with the next folks you meet. They won't all ask first","We're square. Go on, and good luck to you","Alright. Nobody's stopping you. Keep your head down","Go on, then. I hope you find what you're after","Take care of yourself. I mean that","Go on about your business then, no trouble","You're free to go - keep your nose clean"}},
{"ENC_PART","reg=swat,military,elite",{"That's all I needed. Go on, watch yourself","We're done here. Keep your distance as you go","Off you go. Stay out of trouble out there","Walk on. Nobody's stopping you","Go on, slow. Hands low until you're past us","Get going. Good luck, you'll need it","You're clear - move along"}},
{"ENC_PART","reg=outlaw,club,crime",{"Off you go, then. Tell folks we were gentle about it","That's all. Walk easy, and don't look back - it spooks my people","We're square. Go on before the mood changes","You've been a pleasure. Mostly. Move along","Go your way, and keep that luck of yours. It's been good so far","Get on, then. And if you see us again, wave first","Go on, then, don't let me see you twice"}},
{"ENC_PART","reg=raider,gang,prison",{"Alright, scram. Go on","We're done. Don't make me regret this","Walk away, and don't turn around","Lucky day for you, buddy. Don't push it","Go on. Be glad I'm in a good mood","Run along. We might meet again, and I might not be so friendly","Get moving, before I change my mind"}},
{"ENC_REPLY_DOUBT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"That doesn't sound right. Say it again","Uh-huh. And I'm the governor","You're leaving something out. I can tell","Somebody's lying here, and it isn't me","No... no, I don't think that's all of it","My daddy used to say the quickest answer is the crooked one","I don't know if I believe you"}},
{"ENC_REPLY_DOUBT","reg=law",{"Funny, that's not what your face is saying","Mm-hm. Say that again, slower","You sure about that? Think it over","I've been lied to by better than you","That story has a hole in it. Want to patch it?","Try again, and this time use the truth","Sure, I've heard that one before"}},
{"ENC_REPLY_DOUBT","reg=swat,military,elite",{"Uh-huh. That's not how it looks from here","Don't insult me. Try the truth this time","That doesn't add up. Say it again, slower","Bullshit. Try again","Maybe. I'm not buying it yet","Your story's got holes in it. Want to patch them?","Noted - we'll see"}},
{"ENC_REPLY_DOUBT","reg=outlaw,club,crime",{"Funny, that's not how your eyes tell it","You say that like you practiced it in a mirror","I've been lied to by experts. You're not one","Try that again, and this time put some truth in it","Sure. And I just fell off the hay wagon too","That sounded rehearsed. Badly","Uh-huh, sure you do"}},
{"ENC_REPLY_DOUBT","reg=raider,gang,prison",{"Yeah? And I'm the governor","Bullshit. Try again, slower","Funny, your face don't match your mouth","I grew up around liars. You're not even a good one","Nah. Nope. Not buying a word of it","That's a pretty story. Got another one?","Bull - you're lying"}},
{"ENC_REPLY_OK","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"Okay. Okay, that makes sense","Mm. All right then","Well, that's honest enough for me","Huh. I figured it'd be worse than that","That's... yeah. I can believe that","Good. That's one less thing to be scared of","Yeah, fair, I can live with that"}},
{"ENC_REPLY_OK","reg=law",{"Reckon that's fair","Good enough for me","Huh. A straight answer. Don't get many of those","That sounds about right","Mm. Alright then","Okay. I believe you, for now","Alright, that's good"}},
{"ENC_REPLY_OK","reg=swat,military,elite",{"Fine. That works for me","Alright... that'll do","Okay. That matches what I figured","That tracks. Stay easy","Good enough. For now","Mm. Alright, I'll take it","Understood"}},
{"ENC_REPLY_OK","reg=outlaw,club,crime",{"Fair enough. You talk straight, I'll give you that","That'll do, that'll do","Huh. I was ready to dislike you. Disappointing","Good answer. I was half hoping for a bad one","Mm-hm. Alright, I like that better than I expected","Sensible. I appreciate sensible","Alright, I can work with that"}},
{"ENC_REPLY_OK","reg=raider,gang,prison",{"Huh. Fair enough","That'll work. For now","Sounds about right","Good. Keep talking like that and we'll get along","Okay, okay. You ain't dumb","Mm, honest. Don't see much of that","Yeah, okay"}},
{"ENC_REVENGE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"You. I know that face. You hurt my people","That's {him}! Right there - that's who did it!","We buried them because of you. Did you think we'd forget?","Don't you move. Not after what you did to ours","That's the one who shot at us - you remember us?"}},
{"ENC_REVENGE","reg=law",{"There you are. Some of mine never walked away from you","Don't bother with a story. I know what you did to my people","Badge or no badge, you're answering for what you did to us","You remember us? I sure remember you. Every night","That's {him}, you're coming with us, one way or the other"}},
{"ENC_REVENGE","reg=swat,military,elite",{"That's the one who put our people in the ground. Spread out","Look at the face. Look at it - that's who we've been looking for","Found you. We've been walking a long time for this","You know who we are. You know what you did. Weapons up","Positive ID, that's the shooter - weapons up"}},
{"ENC_REVENGE","reg=outlaw,club,crime",{"There you are. We've been asking after you since you put one of ours in the dirt","Don't bother lying. We all know your face, and we all know what it did","Look at that, you walked right to us. Somebody up there likes me","You hurt ours and thought nobody would come asking. We're asking","Remember us? You hurt our people, that bill's come due"}},
{"ENC_REVENGE","reg=raider,gang,prison",{"That's {him}! {He} put my brother in the ground!","You hurt our people. Remember?","Look who wandered into our lap. Keep {him} breathing, I got plans","You! You left us two men short and walked off like it was nothing","Found you! You thought we'd just let it go?"}},
