{"ENC_SEARCH_START","reg=law",{"Let's search carefully. We don't know what we'll find"}},
{"ENC_SEARCH_START","reg=swat,military,elite",{"Building search - move slow, check every room"}},
{"ENC_SEARCH_START","reg=outlaw,club,crime",{"Check the house, somebody's in there"}},
{"ENC_SEARCH_START","reg=raider,gang,prison",{"In there - go find {him}"}},
{"ENC_SILENCE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"Well? Are you going to say anything?","Can you talk? Are you able to talk?","Nod, at least. Nod if you understand me","Are you listening? Because I'm trying to be patient","I'm talking, you know. A word would help","Come on... don't just stand there staring at me","Hello? Can you hear me? Please answer"}},
{"ENC_SILENCE","reg=law",{"Well? I'm listening","Take your time. Just not too much of it","Can you hear me? Nod if you can","Speak up, now. Quiet doesn't help either of us","Looking at me won't answer it","Anybody home in there? I asked you something","Will you answer me?","I asked you a question"}},
{"ENC_SILENCE","reg=swat,military,elite",{"Hello? I'm talking to you","Well? Say something","Did you hear me? Open your mouth and answer","Don't go quiet on me. What's the answer?","I can see you thinking about it. Quit thinking, start talking","Speak up. I can't read your mind","I asked you a question - answer it"}},
{"ENC_SILENCE","reg=outlaw,club,crime",{"Take your time. I'm in no hurry, but my friends here are","Don't go shy on me now. Say something","Hello? Open your mouth and let a word fall out","Quiet type, huh? I like quiet. I like answers better","That a no, or are you just thinking? Think faster","You hard of hearing? I can say it louder, it's no trouble","Cat got your tongue? I asked you something","I'm waiting"}},
{"ENC_SILENCE","reg=raider,gang,prison",{"Anybody home in that head of yours?","You mute, or just stupid?","I asked you something. Open your mouth and use it","Don't make me come over there and ask again","Tick tock, buddy. I got patience for about a second","Even a lie'd do. Go on, say something","Hey! I'm talking to you!"}},
